===Etymology===
{{prefix|hypo|thalamus}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|hypothalami}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} A region of the [[forebrain]] located below the [[thalamus]], forming the basal portion of the [[diencephalon]], and functioning to regulate body temperature, some metabolic processes and governing the [[autonomic nervous system]].

====Derived terms====
* [[hypothalamic]]

